OL,5,G2300 Special Ops: Crime Squad UK
OL,6,     FSpecial police task forces tackle
OL,7,     Fviolent drug dealers in
OL,8,     FGloucestershire, a fraudster in
OL,9,     FLondon, and a cruel gang making
OL,10,     Fmoney illegally trading over two
OL,11,     Fhundred wild birds from a pub.
OL,12,G0000 Special Ops: Crime Squad UK
