OL,14,     Fdrug-dealing gang, farmers in
OL,15,     FNorthamptonshire are targeted by a
OL,16,     Fgang in the countryside, and a
OL,17,     Fcrime squad in Kent investigate
OL,18,     Fresidential burglaries.
